\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Format and answer accuracy are separable channels in chart RLVR. \textbf  {Left:} a stylized rollout under each training regime. GRPO emits the required structural tags and the correct answer; NSR drops both; NSR$+$HCPC recovers the answer while the structured tags remain collapsed. \textbf  {Right:} ChartFC (OOD) metrics for the same three regimes. Adding HCPC on top of NSR restores Pass@1 and Pass@4 to near GRPO levels, but format compliance barely moves from NSR's collapsed value (16.2\% to 17.8\%). Accuracy returns; format does not. The dissociation is direct evidence that these two behaviors respond independently to training interventions.}}{2}{figure.caption.1}\protected@file@percent }
\providecommand*\caption@xref[2]{\@setref\relax\@undefined{#1}}
\newlabel{fig:pipeline}{{1}{2}{Format and answer accuracy are separable channels in chart RLVR. \textbf {Left:} a stylized rollout under each training regime. GRPO emits the required structural tags and the correct answer; NSR drops both; NSR$+$HCPC recovers the answer while the structured tags remain collapsed. \textbf {Right:} ChartFC (OOD) metrics for the same three regimes. Adding HCPC on top of NSR restores Pass@1 and Pass@4 to near GRPO levels, but format compliance barely moves from NSR's collapsed value (16.2\% to 17.8\%). Accuracy returns; format does not. The dissociation is direct evidence that these two behaviors respond independently to training interventions}{figure.caption.1}{}}
